# telegram/.gitignore — self-contained ignore rules for this folder
#
# Added 2026-08-18 so this folder is safe to `git add .` inside ANY repo it's
# copied into (a website repo, a fresh clone, anywhere) without depending on
# the cap-online repo's own root .gitignore also being present. Mirrors that
# root file's telegram-relevant rules, rewritten relative to telegram/ itself
# — if you change one, check whether the other needs the same change.
#
# Principle (same as the root file): no binary files, no secrets, no
# generated/runtime state in git. Source/text is tracked; everything heavy,
# binary, secret, or regenerable is excluded.

# Secrets / credentials -- never commit live tokens/keys
.env
*.env
creds.txt
**/creds.txt

# Documents / office binaries (student-facing PDFs etc. -- real content,
# kept on disk, never in git; see FIRST_PROMPT.md on how these get here)
**/*.pdf
**/*.docx
**/*.doc
**/*.pptx
**/*.ppt
**/*.xlsx
**/*.xls

# Images (raster)
**/*.jpg
**/*.jpeg
**/*.png
**/*.gif
**/*.bmp
**/*.tiff
**/*.tif
**/*.webp
**/*.psd
**/*.ico

# Audio / video (e.g. any future voice-note or explainer-video features)
**/*.mp3
**/*.wav
**/*.m4a
**/*.aac
**/*.flac
**/*.ogg
**/*.mp4
**/*.mov
**/*.mkv
**/*.avi
**/*.webm
**/*.wmv

# Archives & executables / large binaries
**/*.zip
**/*.rar
**/*.7z
**/*.tar
**/*.gz
**/*.exe
**/*.dll
**/*.msi
**/*.bin
**/*.iso

# Databases (binary; platform.db, myfiles_hub.db, and any *.db-wal/-shm)
**/*.db
**/*.db-wal
**/*.db-shm
**/*.sqlite
**/*.sqlite3

# Python
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
*$py.class
*.pyo
*.pyd
.pytest_cache/
.mypy_cache/
.python-version
pip-log.txt

# Virtual environments -- NOT bundled with this folder; recreate via
# `pip install -r telegram/requirements.txt` after copying telegram/ anywhere
.venv/
venv/
ENV/
env/
env.bak/
venv.bak/

# Packaging
build/
dist/
*.egg-info/
.installed.cfg
*.egg

# Editor / OS
.idea/
.vscode/
.ipynb_checkpoints/
.spyproject
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
desktop.ini

# Telegram-specific runtime/generated state (local only, regenerates itself)
tools/_reports/
database/run/
assets/myfiles_bot/
assets/exam_bot/Tests/uploads/
